  "description": "ROAD OR TRAIL, NO LIMITS New from the ground up for 2019, the Solum series is your do-it-all two-wheeled Swiss Army Knife. Equally at home on smooth pavement or fire road trails, the Solum will let you choose your own path. Featuring an all-new Rider-Optimized Geometry to make sure you always get the most comfortable ride, no matter where it takes you.\nHaro Solum Dual Sport frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, mechanically-shaped alloy tubing, internal cable routing and chainstay disc brake mount\nSR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork wiht 63mm travel and hydraulic lockout\nShimano TY-501 crankset, 48/38/28 and sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Altus 8-spd shifters, front and rear derailleurs\nShimano M315 hydraulic disc brakes\nPivit disc brake hubs and lightweight double wall rims\nNew Pivit alloy 9* sweep riser bar, and forged stem\nKenda Bitumen 700 x 38c tire",
